-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">참여 희망 동아리가 다수일 경우 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">① </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">농산어촌 및 구도심 지역 활동을 희망한 동아리 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">② </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">제출한 운영계획서의 실현가능성 등을 함께 고려하여 선정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">추진일정 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">모집</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">차서류 심사</span><span style=\"FON